00:23:02.900 --> 00:23:04.320
We all took a little something.

462
00:23:04.480 --> 00:23:05.220
Did you take something?

463
00:23:05.480 --> 00:23:06.140
I didn't.

464
00:23:06.200 --> 00:23:07.180
I didn't take anything.

465
00:23:07.420 --> 00:23:07.760
What?

466
00:23:08.160 --> 00:23:08.560
Randall!

