00:23:14.680 --> 00:23:18.200
And if I took a pencil holder that we, you know, we wouldn't come back.

470
00:23:18.340 --> 00:23:18.900
I didn't.

471
00:23:18.980 --> 00:23:19.820
I didn't take anything.

472
00:23:19.980 --> 00:23:20.580
I swear.

