00:23:25.360 --> 00:23:27.200
Yeah, I spent my plaque with my name on it.

475
00:23:27.280 --> 00:23:28.480
I think that was pretty cool.

476
00:23:28.640 --> 00:23:29.540
I don't know what I would take.

477
00:23:29.780 --> 00:23:31.340
Toaster oven from the fire.

478
00:23:31.800 --> 00:23:33.000
Yeah, there you go.

479
00:23:33.260 --> 00:23:33.660
Nice.

480
00:23:35.200 --> 00:23:37.260
Well, we should share it with our listeners.

481
00:23:37.420 --> 00:23:41.880
And I think, you know, a lot of Office Ladies fans will know this, that Randall, you went

482
00:23:41.880 --> 00:23:47.780
on and now are a prolific director and you're directing all kinds of amazing shows.

483
00:23:47.840 --> 00:23:51.260
And I got to work with you post office on Wilfred.

484
00:23:51.540 --> 00:23:52.760
That was really fun.

485
00:23:53.680 --> 00:23:54.660
Weird little show.

486
00:23:54.800 --> 00:23:55.720
Weird little show.

487
00:23:56.000 --> 00:23:57.880
But such a fun group of people.

488
00:23:58.120 --> 00:24:01.080
I was just there one day, but I loved the vibe on that set.

489
00:24:01.080 --> 00:24:06.760
But you are, you are just out there crushing it, as the kids say.

490
00:24:08.660 --> 00:24:12.800
Randall, do you have any upcoming projects or anything we can share with everyone to check

491
00:24:12.800 --> 00:24:13.080
out?

