00:47:52.030 --> 00:47:55.910
Just give us some pockets and all of our problems will be solved.

1000
00:47:56.290 --> 00:47:58.010
Give us some dang pockets.

1001
00:47:58.590 --> 00:47:58.910
All right.

1002
00:47:59.070 --> 00:48:00.650
