00:49:06.390 --> 00:49:08.230
So maybe he could flip it.

1019
00:49:08.590 --> 00:49:12.910
You know, he says if he could make a living, he'd make a million.

1020
00:49:13.110 --> 00:49:13.550
It's true.

1021
00:49:13.770 --> 00:49:16.190
That's how much money he could make loving you.

1022
00:49:16.410 --> 00:49:20.650
Well, I went back and watched the music video for this and I found the moment,

1023
00:49:20.650 --> 00:49:25.270
the blurry moment where I'm in the video and I'm going to put it in our stories.

1024
00:49:25.610 --> 00:49:26.350
Oh, my gosh.

