12 hours.

1035
00:49:53.230 --> 00:49:53.890
And no.

1036
00:49:54.390 --> 00:49:54.530
Yeah.

1037
00:49:54.870 --> 00:49:55.390
Oh, yeah.

1038
00:49:55.690 --> 00:49:56.630
You guys, wait.

